# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` and paste your real key there.
# `.dev.vars` is gitignored — it is only used by `wrangler pages dev`.
# In production the key lives as a Cloudflare secret, not in any file.

# New Gemini keys (2026) look like: AQ.Ab8RN6...
# Legacy keys look like:            AIzaSy...
GEMINI_KEY=paste-your-key-here
